warning[no_effect]: this statement has no effect
  --> tests/lint/no_effect/example.jai:5:5
   |
 5 |     total + 1;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: to update `total`, write `total += 1;`
   |
 4       total := 1;
 5 ~     total += 1;
 6       print("%\n", total);
   |
   = note: `no_effect` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/no_effect
